# SPRINT S03-001 — Mixed Carrier Packet Admission

**Parent SAGA:** [SAGA-03 — Task Admission and Heterogeneous Carrier Bundles](saga_03_task_admission_and_carriers.md)  
**LifecycleStatus:** BLOCKED
**GtocTerminal:** NOT_EVALUATED
**AuthorityStatus:** None
**AuthorityEffect:** `None`
**Frozen base:** UNFROZEN - exact Git commit required before READY or ACTIVE
**Packet hash:** UNCOMPUTED - exact canonical packet SHA-256 required before READY or ACTIVE
**Observer hash:** UNCOMPUTED - frozen observer required before admission
**Attempt budget:** 1
**Successor budget:** 1
**Time budget:** 8 hours
**Process budget:** 4 maximum
**Token budget:** 200000 maximum
